-- the three identity relations, on real pairs of records. The identity crisis of hyperactivity's 10.8 is
-- that digest equality, definitional equality and a specified relation between interpreted meanings are
-- three statements (10.22), and chemistry collapses them into string equality of a canonical identifier.
-- Here are six pairs of records, each a documented case, with the three relations as they actually stand.
--
-- a pair of records, by the three relations: whether their identifiers are the same string, whether their
-- constructions are the same construction, and whether they are the same substance
Trio : Type 0
Trio = (digest : Bool) × ((defn : Bool) × Bool)
